WEBVTT

01:30.600 --> 01:34.950
[The Heir]

01:35.420 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 6]

01:44.070 --> 01:46.310
Grandfather, where are we?

01:48.400 --> 01:50.840
This is the old ink workshop
of the Li family.

01:50.840 --> 01:52.970
You've been here when you were little.

02:01.590 --> 02:02.790
I remember now.

02:03.350 --> 02:05.590
My father brought me here
when I was little.

02:05.590 --> 02:06.560
My father said

02:06.710 --> 02:09.000
he learned how to boil glue here.

02:15.840 --> 02:16.840
Yes.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.240
This

02:21.750 --> 02:23.800
is where Li Ink has its roots.

02:25.840 --> 02:27.150
Li Ink originates

02:28.000 --> 02:30.180
from the Xi family of the Southern Tang.

02:30.180 --> 02:31.460
Due to constant wars,

02:32.470 --> 02:35.590
the Xi family moved from Yishui
to Huizhou in the south.

02:36.710 --> 02:38.630
They used ancient pine wood
from southern Anhui as material

02:38.630 --> 02:40.030
and created Li Ink.

02:41.750 --> 02:44.240
Later,
the last emperor of the Southern Tang

02:44.430 --> 02:47.800
appointed our ancestor Xi Tinggui
as the Ink Affairs Official

02:47.800 --> 02:49.870
and bestowed upon him
the imperial surname Li.

02:49.870 --> 02:50.750
From then on,

02:51.190 --> 02:52.910
Li Ink became widely known,

02:55.710 --> 02:56.710
and our ancestors

02:57.520 --> 02:59.030
were highly honored.

03:01.750 --> 03:03.400
It all began

03:04.000 --> 03:06.560
in this small ink workshop,

03:07.430 --> 03:09.490
which led to the prosperity of Li Ink.

03:13.560 --> 03:14.430
Zhen.

03:18.630 --> 03:19.710
Do you know

03:20.120 --> 03:22.720
why there are so many ink workshops
in Huizhou,

03:22.840 --> 03:24.079
yet only Li Ink

03:24.190 --> 03:27.450
has been passed down for centuries
without interruption?

03:28.190 --> 03:31.870
Because Li Ink
has the world-famous Sihe Ink.

03:34.520 --> 03:36.190
Sihe Ink has long been lost.

03:37.000 --> 03:39.310
I could only catch a glimpse of it

03:39.310 --> 03:41.240
in the portraits of our ancestors.

03:41.840 --> 03:44.030
Could it be because of these 2 words?

03:45.310 --> 03:48.130
[Upright and Honorable]

03:51.120 --> 03:52.000
Exactly.

03:55.520 --> 03:56.560
Li Ink

03:58.360 --> 03:59.710
is righteous

03:59.960 --> 04:01.820
and never clings to the powerful.

04:02.710 --> 04:05.510
Ink makers must cultivate
their moral character,

04:06.430 --> 04:08.520
be cautious when alone,
and keep a calm mind

04:08.520 --> 04:10.650
in order to embody the "bone" of Li Ink.

04:11.360 --> 04:12.710
I understand, Grandfather.

04:12.710 --> 04:13.770
As the saying goes,

04:13.910 --> 04:15.560
a clear conscience

04:15.560 --> 04:17.000
fears no midnight knock.

04:17.190 --> 04:19.800
Righteous thoughts and deeds
lead to righteous results.

04:19.800 --> 04:20.750
Am I right?

04:21.600 --> 04:22.930
You are only half right.

04:24.480 --> 04:27.600
The way of ink making
also requires self-cultivation.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.120
Eldest Aunt?

04:37.800 --> 04:38.680
Eldest Aunt,

04:38.950 --> 04:40.070
why are you here?

04:40.120 --> 04:41.850
I came to bring you some things.

04:42.430 --> 04:43.240
Eighth Uncle.

04:43.830 --> 04:44.950
I've brought all the things.

04:44.950 --> 04:46.010
Please take a look.

04:46.090 --> 04:47.330
Lamp oil, lamp wicks,

04:47.360 --> 04:48.560
and some molds.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.750
If it's not enough,

04:49.750 --> 04:51.270
I'll figure something out.

04:51.270 --> 04:52.270
That's enough.

05:01.310 --> 05:04.240
Please thank Rujun for me.

05:04.240 --> 05:06.310
This must have put her
in a difficult position.

05:06.310 --> 05:09.640
Eighth Uncle, Jingdong is in charge
of the ink workshop now.

05:09.720 --> 05:11.560
He did complain a bit,

05:11.870 --> 05:13.330
but since Mother spoke up,

05:13.360 --> 05:15.390
he didn't dare say anything more.

05:15.870 --> 05:18.310
It's just that I took a look
when they were loading the goods.

05:18.310 --> 05:21.190
Many of them are defective products
from the warehouse.

05:21.190 --> 05:22.800
I don't know if they can be used.

05:22.800 --> 05:23.860
It doesn't matter.

05:24.430 --> 05:25.600
Right now, this girl

05:25.870 --> 05:27.470
doesn't need the good stuff.

05:28.040 --> 05:28.920
Grandfather.

05:29.510 --> 05:31.040
Seventh Grandmother knows

05:31.240 --> 05:32.870
about me learning to make ink?

05:32.870 --> 05:35.270
Without Seventh Grandmother's approval,

05:35.659 --> 05:37.170
do you think we could use

05:37.360 --> 05:38.560
this ink workshop?

05:41.560 --> 05:42.560
Zhen.

05:43.070 --> 05:44.750
Your Seventh Grandmother said

05:44.750 --> 05:45.680
you don't have to

05:45.800 --> 05:47.730
worry too much about these things.

05:48.070 --> 05:50.480
It's the reward you deserve
for helping her

05:50.480 --> 05:52.190
raise fish and flowers
when you were young.

05:52.190 --> 05:53.680
She also asked me to pass a message.

05:53.680 --> 05:56.120
If you want to learn to make ink,
learn it well.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.800
When you finish your apprenticeship,

05:57.800 --> 05:59.270
she will come to test you.

06:19.720 --> 06:20.680
Grandfather!

06:20.720 --> 06:22.360
I've set up the lamp bowls.

06:23.000 --> 06:23.870
Zhen.

06:24.870 --> 06:25.720
Grandfather.

06:26.030 --> 06:26.660
I know

06:26.690 --> 06:27.950
the first step in making ink

06:27.950 --> 06:29.120
is lighting the lamps
and gathering the lampblack.

06:29.120 --> 06:30.630
I already mastered it

06:30.630 --> 06:32.430
when I was secretly learning it.

06:35.630 --> 06:37.120
Twist these lamp wicks

06:37.600 --> 06:38.360
into strips.

06:42.390 --> 06:43.190
Grandfather,

06:43.240 --> 06:45.000
nowadays all the ink workshops

06:45.040 --> 06:46.920
buy ready-made ones.

06:47.270 --> 06:49.070
Why are you making me learn this?

06:51.240 --> 06:52.190
Zhen,

06:53.120 --> 06:54.159
for others,

06:54.600 --> 06:56.720
the first step in making ink might be
gathering the lampblack.

06:56.720 --> 06:57.680
But for you,

06:58.430 --> 07:00.560
you must start by twisting lamp wicks.

07:03.560 --> 07:04.360
I see.

07:20.360 --> 07:20.830
Grandfather,

07:20.830 --> 07:21.600
I'm done.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.060
Uneven thickness.

07:26.310 --> 07:27.070
Do it again.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.600
Uneven thickness...

07:41.120 --> 07:43.870
Then I'll twist an even one
for you to see.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.390
I've twisted so many.

08:12.390 --> 08:13.990
There must be one that works.

08:14.040 --> 08:14.600
Grandfather,

08:14.600 --> 08:16.200
can I move on to the next step?

08:20.040 --> 08:20.600
No.

08:20.600 --> 08:21.560
Why?

08:22.480 --> 08:23.510
See?

08:23.950 --> 08:25.120
Uneven length.

08:26.000 --> 08:27.360
You can't expect me

08:27.360 --> 08:28.720
to make the length of every single one

08:28.720 --> 08:29.870
exactly the same.

08:30.040 --> 08:31.800
Only when you can make

08:32.000 --> 08:33.200
lamp wicks

08:33.440 --> 08:35.030
that are all uniform
in length and thickness,

08:35.030 --> 08:36.320
tightly twisted, and won't come loose

08:36.320 --> 08:38.780
can you move on to the next step
of making ink.

08:38.870 --> 08:40.270
I just don't understand.

08:40.510 --> 08:42.080
Making lamp wicks is only a minor skill.

08:42.080 --> 08:43.909
Everyone in Huizhou knows how to do it.

08:43.909 --> 08:45.030
If I'm just here twisting lamp wicks,

08:45.030 --> 08:45.840
wouldn't that just be a waste of time?

08:45.840 --> 08:46.600
Zhen.

08:47.390 --> 08:49.210
Then teach me how to twist lamp wicks.

08:49.210 --> 08:50.240
Twisting lamp wicks

08:50.240 --> 08:51.440
just takes practice.

08:52.790 --> 08:53.910
I don't believe it.

08:54.080 --> 08:56.480
Did Li Ink achieve what it has today

08:56.500 --> 08:58.410
by twisting lamp wicks?

09:00.120 --> 09:01.460
I told you before

09:02.310 --> 09:03.910
that if you want to learn
ink-making from me,

09:03.910 --> 09:05.370
you must follow the rules.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.200
If you cannot complete every step

09:07.200 --> 09:07.960
and meet the required standards,

09:07.960 --> 09:10.360
then there is no point
in learning it at all!

09:17.670 --> 09:18.470
Grandfather.

09:19.200 --> 09:20.000
Zhen.

09:20.750 --> 09:22.350
What's going on with you two?

09:22.480 --> 09:23.670
Why are you here?

09:24.540 --> 09:27.090
Mom asked me to call you home for dinner.

09:27.110 --> 09:32.880
[Chi Luo Hun: Ancient Huizhou dialect.
It means having dinner]

09:28.630 --> 09:30.120
You go ahead and eat.

09:30.120 --> 09:31.360
I can't.

09:31.440 --> 09:33.840
Grandfather is making me twist lamp wicks.

09:35.550 --> 09:36.390
Zhen,

09:36.670 --> 09:37.800
have you forgotten?

09:37.910 --> 09:39.720
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival,

09:39.720 --> 09:41.150
a day for family reunion.

09:41.720 --> 09:43.520
We can't celebrate without you.

09:43.790 --> 09:44.390
Here,

09:44.440 --> 09:46.240
I bought this specially for you.

10:24.320 --> 10:25.250
Time for dinner.

10:34.670 --> 10:35.550
Dinner time.

10:36.200 --> 10:36.840
Let's go.

10:40.120 --> 10:41.240
Wait for me!

10:41.600 --> 10:42.600
Wait for me!

11:03.240 --> 11:04.150
Do you think we can

11:04.150 --> 11:06.280
get to the lantern temple fair in time?

11:06.510 --> 11:07.630
Let me tell you,

11:07.630 --> 11:09.090
don't even think about it.

11:09.200 --> 11:10.240
When our Young Master

11:10.240 --> 11:11.440
starts making ink,

11:11.510 --> 11:13.510
he's like a monk in deep meditation.

11:14.750 --> 11:16.550
It's the Mid-Autumn Festival.

11:16.550 --> 11:18.840
It's a pity
to miss the lantern temple fair.

11:18.840 --> 11:20.370
What are you talking about?

11:24.270 --> 11:25.230
Shut up.

11:37.870 --> 11:38.670
Young Master.

11:39.670 --> 11:42.270
There's a letter
from the Second Young Master.

11:52.390 --> 11:53.200
Well...

11:53.440 --> 11:54.390
What is it?

11:56.370 --> 11:57.570
Never mind. Nothing.

11:57.870 --> 11:59.030
I'll go out first.

12:02.080 --> 12:03.030
Young Master.

12:03.440 --> 12:04.320
Today...

12:04.870 --> 12:06.080
Today is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

12:06.080 --> 12:07.320
Let...

12:08.240 --> 12:10.370
Let everyone go home for the festival.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.360
Okay!

12:11.550 --> 12:13.950
Should we go to
the lantern temple fair too?

12:14.080 --> 12:16.210
Why don't you accompany me to make ink?

12:17.620 --> 12:19.570
I'll go...

12:19.600 --> 12:22.400
tell the workers
to go home for the festival first.

12:23.200 --> 12:26.060
Dear Brother,
seeing this letter is like seeing me.

12:26.670 --> 12:28.030
When you receive this letter,

12:28.030 --> 12:30.040
it should be
around the Mid-Autumn Festival.

12:30.040 --> 12:31.400
Are you alone again

12:31.430 --> 12:33.160
making ink in the ink workshop?

12:33.270 --> 12:35.550
Everything is fine with me in the Capital.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.750
Especially the small business
Jixiang and I

12:36.750 --> 12:38.380
have been running at the academy.

12:38.380 --> 12:40.120
It has been doing better recently.

12:40.120 --> 12:42.120
This is a small business.

12:42.170 --> 12:43.590
[Luo Wenqian,
the second son of the Luo family]

12:42.270 --> 12:43.670
No credit allowed.

12:43.960 --> 12:44.790
Look.

12:44.790 --> 12:45.690
It is brave and skilled in battle.

12:45.690 --> 12:47.480
It has won 18 matches in a row out there.

12:47.480 --> 12:48.270
This...

12:48.270 --> 12:49.000
I have money.

12:51.750 --> 12:52.840
Put it all down.

12:53.150 --> 12:53.870
Hurry up.

12:54.120 --> 12:54.720
Jixiang.

12:55.750 --> 12:57.790
Father is getting more and more
short-tempered.

12:57.790 --> 12:59.790
He always scolds me
for not doing honest work.

12:59.790 --> 13:01.450
Maybe it's because I recently

13:01.460 --> 13:02.870
angered 2 more teachers
so much that they left.

13:02.870 --> 13:03.790
Luo Wenqian!

13:03.810 --> 13:05.720
You are not allowed
to come to my academy again!

13:05.720 --> 13:07.000
If you don't teach him,

13:07.000 --> 13:08.200
who can he learn from?

13:08.200 --> 13:08.720
Right?

13:08.750 --> 13:10.870
He's a lost cause.

13:10.910 --> 13:11.550
I can't teach him.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.600
I really don't want to be an official.

13:13.600 --> 13:14.870
Doing business suits me better.

13:14.870 --> 13:17.150
If you don't study hard,

13:17.320 --> 13:18.360
what are you going to do in the future?

13:18.360 --> 13:20.160
My aunt said that doing business

13:20.320 --> 13:23.050
isn't necessarily worse
than being an official.

13:23.200 --> 13:24.510
Besides, many men in Huizhou

13:24.510 --> 13:25.750
are out doing business.

13:25.750 --> 13:27.280
Once I learn to do business,

13:27.480 --> 13:30.810
I'll help you open Luo's Ink Shops
in every part of the world.

13:31.320 --> 13:32.750
Too obedient a boy
won't amount to anything.

13:32.750 --> 13:34.440
General Yu Dayong returned to the Capital
a few days ago to report on his duties.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.910
Wenqian looks like a good boy.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.770
He dropped by our house on the way.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.870
Then I'll go with Uncle Yu
to the military camp right away.

13:39.870 --> 13:40.550
Did you hear that?

13:39.920 --> 13:41.620
[Yu Dayong, General of Fujian]

13:40.550 --> 13:41.390
This boy.

13:41.390 --> 13:42.240
I actually think

13:42.240 --> 13:44.080
getting some experience
in the military camp with him

13:44.080 --> 13:46.120
would be more interesting than studying.

13:46.120 --> 13:48.750
Brother, how is your new ink coming along?

13:49.840 --> 13:51.030
Today I heard

13:51.080 --> 13:53.000
that Jiang's Bookstore
has the only existing copy

13:53.000 --> 13:54.060
of Ink Chronicles.

13:54.080 --> 13:56.610
I will definitely get it for you
within 7 days.

13:56.840 --> 13:58.000
Once I get the book,

13:58.240 --> 13:59.870
I will send it to Huizhou immediately

13:59.870 --> 14:02.480
to help you develop the new ink.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.270
That fast?

14:05.990 --> 14:06.640
You know,

14:06.660 --> 14:07.870
selling this book to me for 100 taels

14:07.870 --> 14:09.320
doesn't put you at a loss.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.000
Careful.

14:10.000 --> 14:11.200
This is the only copy.

14:11.750 --> 14:13.270
This one. Ink Chronicles.

14:14.510 --> 14:17.040
We only have an incomplete copy
in our family.

14:17.270 --> 14:19.200
You are from a family of ink makers?

14:19.600 --> 14:20.320
Luo Ink.

14:20.320 --> 14:21.450
Have you heard of it?

14:21.840 --> 14:22.270
Good.

14:22.360 --> 14:22.710
Good.

14:23.150 --> 14:24.410
Alright. I'm leaving.

14:24.960 --> 14:25.600
Come back.

14:25.600 --> 14:26.690
I'll wrap it for you.

14:26.690 --> 14:27.500
It's fine.

14:28.270 --> 14:28.800
Brother,

14:29.230 --> 14:31.320
will we spend the Mid-Autumn Festival
together next year?

14:31.320 --> 14:33.240
I miss you, and I miss Aunt too.

14:33.670 --> 14:35.240
Your brother, Wenqian.

14:36.040 --> 14:37.360
Little brat.

15:05.320 --> 15:06.600
You reduced yourself

15:06.790 --> 15:08.650
to this state for just a marriage?

15:09.120 --> 15:10.850
You don't want to live anymore?

15:14.040 --> 15:15.570
What's the meaning of this?

15:16.200 --> 15:18.200
You're just putting on a show for me?

15:22.670 --> 15:24.870
I know your heart is full of bitterness,

15:25.150 --> 15:26.030
and hatred,

15:26.870 --> 15:28.330
and a desire to fight back.

15:31.030 --> 15:32.080
Look at me.

15:34.600 --> 15:37.080
If you want to fight, you need leverage.

15:37.550 --> 15:39.280
Running away changes nothing.

15:39.720 --> 15:40.910
Listen to me.

15:41.720 --> 15:42.720
Our Tian family

15:42.870 --> 15:44.800
was originally a merchant family.

15:44.960 --> 15:47.910
We only became servants
of the Luo family after our downfall,

15:47.910 --> 15:50.120
enduring endless humiliation
all these years.

15:50.120 --> 15:52.200
Though we have been freed

15:52.850 --> 15:54.110
from our slave status,

15:54.910 --> 15:56.630
in the eyes of the Luo family

15:56.840 --> 15:58.600
and everyone in Huizhou,

15:59.030 --> 16:01.270
we will always be their servants.

16:01.360 --> 16:02.320
Do you really want to

16:02.320 --> 16:04.650
live your whole life in such humiliation?

16:06.030 --> 16:07.840
I will die eventually.

16:08.150 --> 16:10.360
If you still consider yourself
the eldest son of the Tian family,

16:10.360 --> 16:11.440
remember this:

16:11.600 --> 16:14.330
the future of our family
rests on your shoulders.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.270
Keep pounding.

16:21.440 --> 16:23.840
Let's see what you can achieve
by pounding.

16:24.270 --> 16:25.870
Useless.

16:28.750 --> 16:29.630
Tomorrow,

16:29.720 --> 16:31.030
we will go to the Luo family

16:31.030 --> 16:32.360
to dig a well for your sister.

16:31.860 --> 16:38.710
Digging a Well:
Before a Huizhou woman married, her family would go to the groom's home to dig a well.
This signified that everything she would eat, drink, and use after marriage would come from her own family. This was a traditional wedding custom in ancient Huizhou.

16:32.660 --> 16:33.790
Whether you go or not

16:34.240 --> 16:35.390
is up to you.

16:58.910 --> 16:59.910
Our Tian family

17:00.080 --> 17:02.010
was originally a merchant family.

17:02.150 --> 17:05.400
We only became servants of the Luo family
after our downfall.

17:05.400 --> 17:06.349
Do you really want to

17:06.349 --> 17:08.680
live your whole life in such humiliation?

17:55.750 --> 17:56.640
Wonderful.

18:15.510 --> 18:16.070
Father.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.030
Ping'an,

18:21.160 --> 18:23.160
where is the Eldest Young Master?

18:23.440 --> 18:24.960
He is making ink.

18:25.350 --> 18:26.440
He is quite busy.

18:26.540 --> 18:27.460
As for digging the well,

18:27.460 --> 18:28.790
you can handle it yourselves.

18:28.790 --> 18:30.240
Without the Eldest Young Master present,

18:30.240 --> 18:31.840
this goes against the rules.

18:33.030 --> 18:34.110
In the Luo family,

18:34.240 --> 18:36.640
the Eldest Young Master's word
is the rule.

18:37.510 --> 18:38.270
Also,

18:38.270 --> 18:39.440
after you finish,

18:39.470 --> 18:40.850
don't forget to take the dirt away

18:40.850 --> 18:43.310
so you don't dirty
the Luo family's grounds.

18:44.800 --> 18:45.650
Yes.

18:45.840 --> 18:46.840
In the Luo family,

18:47.350 --> 18:49.640
the Eldest Young Master's word
is the rule.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.510
I understand.

18:50.880 --> 18:52.680
Since the Eldest Young Master isn't here,

18:52.680 --> 18:54.000
we'll do it ourselves.

18:54.220 --> 18:54.560
Let's go.

18:54.560 --> 18:55.240
Wait.

18:56.160 --> 18:58.480
The Eldest Young Master
left another order.

18:58.480 --> 19:00.590
He's at a critical stage
of ink making lately,

19:00.590 --> 19:01.720
so he can't get away.

19:02.400 --> 19:03.640
On the day of the wedding,

19:03.640 --> 19:05.440
just get a small sedan chair

19:05.440 --> 19:07.720
and send her in through the side door.

19:08.210 --> 19:09.960
Waive all other conventional formalities.

19:09.960 --> 19:11.760
Entering through the side door?

19:11.820 --> 19:13.590
Isn't that the ritual
for taking a concubine?

19:13.590 --> 19:15.990
My sister is to be his legal wife,
after all.

19:21.880 --> 19:22.880
Ping'an,

19:23.000 --> 19:24.000
did you

19:24.640 --> 19:26.070
misunderstand him?

19:26.640 --> 19:29.830
Our Ronghua will be his legal wife,
with all the proper formalities observed.

19:29.830 --> 19:31.720
There should be
an eight-bearer sedan chair.

19:31.720 --> 19:32.920
Since you said it yourself

19:32.920 --> 19:35.580
that the Eldest Young Master's word
is the rule,

19:35.880 --> 19:37.200
just do as told.

19:38.590 --> 19:39.590
Yes.

19:39.750 --> 19:40.350
Yes.

19:40.350 --> 19:42.920
No matter which door
our Ronghua enters through,

19:42.920 --> 19:44.770
it's an honor for our Tian family.

19:44.770 --> 19:46.970
Please tell the Eldest Young Master

19:47.160 --> 19:49.110
that everything will be done
according to his wishes.

19:49.110 --> 19:50.170
Good that you know.

19:50.310 --> 19:51.750
Then do as you're told.

19:57.270 --> 19:57.640
Let's go.

19:57.640 --> 19:59.640
Father, why did you agree?

19:59.680 --> 20:01.070
They have gone too far.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.350
What do you know?

20:05.350 --> 20:06.030
Brother,

20:06.270 --> 20:08.070
you should persuade Father too.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.440
Dig the well.

20:13.270 --> 20:15.070
Entering through the side door?

20:15.440 --> 20:17.200
Isn't that taking a concubine?

20:17.200 --> 20:18.720
They are clearly bullying us!

20:18.720 --> 20:19.640
Cancel the engagement!

20:19.640 --> 20:21.030
Yes, Father.

20:21.110 --> 20:22.030
I want to cancel the engagement.

20:22.030 --> 20:22.790
No.

20:22.920 --> 20:24.070
Why?

20:25.510 --> 20:26.640
You have to know

20:27.350 --> 20:28.790
that I worked so hard

20:29.030 --> 20:30.960
to get this marriage for you.

20:31.350 --> 20:32.550
If you cancel it,

20:32.960 --> 20:34.750
all my efforts over the years

20:35.110 --> 20:36.480
will be wasted.

20:37.200 --> 20:39.030
This is not just about you.

20:39.640 --> 20:41.790
It's about the entire Tian family.

20:42.680 --> 20:43.720
If you cancel it

20:44.270 --> 20:46.000
and offend Eldest Young Master Luo,

20:46.000 --> 20:48.070
our Tian family might have to

20:48.160 --> 20:50.620
go back to being servants
for the Luo family.

20:54.300 --> 20:55.020
Ronghua.

20:55.640 --> 20:57.110
If that's the case,

20:57.720 --> 20:58.590
we...

20:59.830 --> 21:01.490
can't cancel the engagement.

21:02.200 --> 21:04.830
Otherwise, if we anger
Eldest Young Master Luo,

21:04.830 --> 21:05.920
what will happen

21:06.110 --> 21:07.640
to our whole family?

21:08.920 --> 21:09.880
Listen to me.

21:10.110 --> 21:11.510
It's just that the bridal sedan chair

21:11.510 --> 21:12.680
will enter through the side door.

21:12.680 --> 21:13.880
In the genealogy book,

21:13.880 --> 21:15.310
you will still be recorded
as his legal wife.

21:15.310 --> 21:16.720
That's good.

21:17.000 --> 21:18.590
Being recorded in the genealogy book

21:18.590 --> 21:19.990
makes you his legal wife.

21:21.400 --> 21:23.130
Are you really willing to let me

21:24.640 --> 21:27.900
enter the Luo family with the rites
for taking a concubine?

21:36.000 --> 21:36.750
Ronghua,

21:38.000 --> 21:40.110
a wife's status depends on her husband.

21:40.110 --> 21:41.710
Marrying into the Luo family

21:41.750 --> 21:43.550
will only bring you advantages,

21:43.960 --> 21:45.240
no disadvantages.

21:45.750 --> 21:47.720
Once you become the Head Madam
of the house,

21:47.720 --> 21:49.510
everyone in the Luo family

21:49.960 --> 21:51.480
will be at your disposal.

21:53.590 --> 21:55.880
As for this minor grievance for now...

21:56.640 --> 21:57.550
listen to me,

21:57.640 --> 21:58.590
just endure it.

21:59.750 --> 22:01.010
Would your mother and I

22:02.030 --> 22:03.480
harm you?

22:16.590 --> 22:17.400
Sister.

22:18.350 --> 22:21.070
Only parents and matchmakers
have a say in one's marriage.

22:21.070 --> 22:22.400
I can't help you.

22:33.350 --> 22:34.270
Brother...

22:37.110 --> 22:38.680
You also think I should

22:41.440 --> 22:44.970
marry into the Luo family with the rites
for taking a concubine?

22:49.400 --> 22:50.270
Just marry him.

23:04.030 --> 23:05.830
Ronghua! Ronghua!

23:17.830 --> 23:18.640
Zhen.

23:20.960 --> 23:21.750
Ronghua?

23:22.960 --> 23:23.960
What's wrong?

23:24.240 --> 23:25.400
Why are you crying?

23:26.310 --> 23:27.510
What's wrong?

23:27.620 --> 23:28.820
Don't cry. Don't cry.

23:30.190 --> 23:31.220
Don't scare me.

23:31.550 --> 23:32.350
Ronghua,

23:32.680 --> 23:33.680
what's wrong?

23:33.720 --> 23:35.830
Eldest Young Master Luo wants me to marry him
with the rites for taking a concubine.

23:35.830 --> 23:37.690
The rites for taking a concubine?

23:38.400 --> 23:38.960
He...

23:39.070 --> 23:40.440
He's too domineering!

23:41.680 --> 23:43.540
Did your parents and your brother

23:43.830 --> 23:45.070
all agree to this?

23:47.750 --> 23:48.510
No way.

23:48.880 --> 23:51.110
This Eldest Young Master Luo
is definitely not a good match for you.

23:51.110 --> 23:53.400
But my father and mother
both want me to marry him,

23:53.400 --> 23:55.030
and my brother too.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.240
Zhen,

23:56.440 --> 23:58.920
I really don't know what to do.

24:02.400 --> 24:03.110
Ronghua.

24:03.920 --> 24:05.440
Do you really want to accept this fate?

24:05.440 --> 24:06.720
I don't want to accept it.

24:06.720 --> 24:07.440
But...

24:07.440 --> 24:08.880
But I can't break off this engagement.

24:08.880 --> 24:10.110
Who says you can't?

24:10.240 --> 24:11.040
Let me ask you.

24:11.160 --> 24:12.030
Deep down,

24:12.160 --> 24:13.400
do you want to break it off?

24:13.400 --> 24:14.030
Yes.

24:14.110 --> 24:14.830
Good.

24:14.920 --> 24:16.030
Since you want to do it,

24:16.030 --> 24:17.590
let's go find Eldest Young Master Luo

24:17.590 --> 24:19.320
and break off this engagement.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.400
Eldest Young Master.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.400
They're here.

24:28.250 --> 24:29.180
Miss Li.

24:29.400 --> 24:31.310
Have you figured it out and decided

24:31.310 --> 24:32.830
to work at Luo Ink?

24:38.480 --> 24:39.750
Who is this?

24:39.750 --> 24:40.440
Well...

24:40.460 --> 24:41.460
It's me.

24:42.270 --> 24:44.330
I'm here to break off the engagement.

24:49.160 --> 24:49.920
Miss Tian,

24:50.750 --> 24:51.200
here's the thing...

24:51.200 --> 24:52.550
Eldest Young Master Luo,

24:52.550 --> 24:53.880
you can't force love.

24:54.030 --> 24:55.350
Please be magnanimous

24:55.440 --> 24:57.840
and write an annulment letter for Ronghua.

25:01.640 --> 25:03.570
You haven't answered my question.

25:04.400 --> 25:07.030
When will you decide to work at Luo Ink?

25:07.070 --> 25:08.030
We're

25:08.030 --> 25:09.070
here today

25:09.110 --> 25:10.880
to discuss the annulment.

25:10.880 --> 25:12.920
Why are you bringing up another thing?

25:12.920 --> 25:13.850
I can't annul it.

25:14.880 --> 25:18.040
Only parents and matchmakers
have a say in one's marriage.

25:18.040 --> 25:19.760
I can't make the decision,

25:19.790 --> 25:21.240
and neither can you.

25:22.480 --> 25:24.080
Let me give you a suggestion.

25:24.310 --> 25:25.970
Go to the Capital to find my father.

25:25.970 --> 25:27.370
He can make the decision.

25:29.890 --> 25:30.520
It's fine.

25:35.030 --> 25:36.430
Eldest Young Master Luo,

25:36.590 --> 25:37.350
I know

25:37.550 --> 25:38.640
that deep down,

25:38.720 --> 25:41.050
you don't care about this marriage at all.

25:41.350 --> 25:42.640
The only thing you care about

25:42.640 --> 25:44.580
is making ink.

25:45.480 --> 25:47.680
Everyone says
you are an ink-obsessed madman.

25:47.680 --> 25:49.240
It is precisely this "madman" label

25:49.240 --> 25:51.400
that shows your deep love for ink.

25:52.510 --> 25:54.400
You and Ronghua
have no feelings for each other.

25:54.400 --> 25:57.030
Why should you be bound
by this old custom?

26:01.510 --> 26:02.960
When it comes to ink-making,

26:02.960 --> 26:05.240
you are always fair and just,

26:05.480 --> 26:06.750
appoint people based on merit,

26:06.750 --> 26:08.720
and never stick rigidly to old rules.

26:08.720 --> 26:10.450
I, Li Zhen, admire you for that.

26:10.750 --> 26:11.510
How come,

26:11.510 --> 26:12.680
when it comes to marriage,

26:12.680 --> 26:14.410
you stick rigidly to the rules?

26:15.160 --> 26:17.830
I just told you not to stick to old ways,

26:17.830 --> 26:20.030
and today you're using that against me.

26:30.880 --> 26:31.680
Move aside.

26:35.070 --> 26:36.240
Such a nice girl.

26:36.880 --> 26:37.550
What a pity.

26:37.550 --> 26:38.880
Her surname is Tian.

26:39.400 --> 26:40.730
What do you mean by that?

26:42.790 --> 26:43.480
I mean,

26:43.480 --> 26:44.790
this good girl

26:44.880 --> 26:45.880
could probably give me

26:45.880 --> 26:47.750
a lovely child someday.

26:47.750 --> 26:49.310
You see, my father

26:49.400 --> 26:50.350
urges me every day

26:50.350 --> 26:51.680
to carry on the family line.

26:51.680 --> 26:53.030
It annoys me so much

26:53.160 --> 26:55.310
that I can't concentrate on making ink.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.790
I should just obey my father.

26:56.790 --> 26:57.350
What...

26:57.510 --> 26:59.030
What are you talking about?

26:59.030 --> 27:00.310
Luo Wensong, you're shameless!

27:00.310 --> 27:01.920
How could you say such...

27:01.920 --> 27:03.980
such frivolous things in front of us?

27:04.310 --> 27:05.970
For your own selfish desires,

27:06.110 --> 27:08.370
are you going to ruin a girl's whole life?

27:09.160 --> 27:10.030
Miss Li,

27:10.310 --> 27:12.510
there's one thing I don't understand.

27:12.980 --> 27:14.430
You see,

27:15.240 --> 27:17.070
you didn't marry Tian Benchang,

27:17.350 --> 27:20.310
and now you won't let me marry a girl
from the Tian family.

27:20.310 --> 27:22.480
Do you want to be with me?

27:22.590 --> 27:23.160
You...

27:23.590 --> 27:24.270
You're...

27:24.270 --> 27:25.400
Nonsense!

27:25.830 --> 27:27.270
I broke off the engagement
with the Tian family

27:27.270 --> 27:29.000
not only because you added fuel
to the fire,

27:29.000 --> 27:30.510
but also because the Tian family

27:30.510 --> 27:31.350
was being two-faced!

27:31.350 --> 27:32.610
Don't you understand?

27:32.640 --> 27:33.960
Don't you?

27:35.030 --> 27:36.760
The reason Tian family wants to

27:37.070 --> 27:38.180
be related to you by marriage—

27:38.180 --> 27:40.500
I believe you know better than I do.

27:40.830 --> 27:42.880
If this marriage really happens,

27:43.070 --> 27:44.200
I'm afraid in the future,

27:44.200 --> 27:46.000
you'll be even less able
to make ink in peace.

27:46.000 --> 27:48.200
You shameless girl!

27:48.720 --> 27:51.580
Who allowed you to disturb
the Eldest Young Master?

27:53.590 --> 27:54.790
Eldest Young Master.

27:55.270 --> 27:56.160
Uncle Tian,

27:56.310 --> 27:57.640
why are you forcing Ronghua?

27:57.640 --> 27:59.300
She doesn't want to marry him.

27:59.480 --> 28:00.680
This is between our Tian family

28:00.680 --> 28:01.720
and the Luo family.

28:01.720 --> 28:02.830
Stay out of it.

28:03.110 --> 28:04.680
Ronghua and I are like sisters.

28:04.680 --> 28:06.280
Her business is my business.

28:06.400 --> 28:08.110
She doesn't like Eldest Young Master Luo
at all.

28:08.110 --> 28:09.270
How can you not care about

28:09.270 --> 28:10.400
her feelings at all?

28:11.550 --> 28:12.750
Eldest Young Master,

28:12.750 --> 28:14.240
it's all my daughter's fault.

28:14.240 --> 28:15.370
Please forgive her.

28:15.680 --> 28:16.480
Rest assured.

28:16.750 --> 28:17.640
This marriage

28:17.830 --> 28:18.640
is settled.

28:18.720 --> 28:20.580
Father, I don't want to marry him!

28:20.590 --> 28:21.510
Bastard!

28:21.680 --> 28:22.400
Even if you die,

28:22.400 --> 28:23.510
you have to die in the Luo family!

28:23.510 --> 28:24.350
Tian Huai'an!

28:25.680 --> 28:26.590
Eldest Young Master.

28:26.590 --> 28:27.240
Let's go!

28:27.920 --> 28:28.240
Father!

28:28.240 --> 28:28.720
Zhen!

28:28.720 --> 28:29.440
Ronghua!

28:31.110 --> 28:32.150
Eldest Young Master Luo!

28:32.150 --> 28:34.280
Please save Ronghua! I'm begging you!

28:34.830 --> 28:37.490
When will you make up your mind
to work at Luo Ink?

28:38.680 --> 28:39.940
As long as you save her,

28:40.000 --> 28:41.200
I'll come right away.

28:44.510 --> 28:45.200
Hurry!

28:45.440 --> 28:46.310
Tian Huai'an!

28:46.960 --> 28:48.070
Don't hit her!

28:52.880 --> 28:54.350
Let go of me!

28:56.510 --> 28:58.070
Let me out!

28:59.070 --> 28:59.880
Sister,

29:00.070 --> 29:02.480
just stay at home
and wait for your wedding.

29:02.590 --> 29:04.160
Let me out!

29:06.070 --> 29:07.590
Let me out!

29:08.040 --> 29:10.950
[Luo's Mansion in the Capital]

29:08.200 --> 29:09.310
I need to see Old Master Luo
for something urgent!

29:09.310 --> 29:10.170
Please come in!

29:13.790 --> 29:16.050
Master, someone from the palace is here.

29:16.640 --> 29:17.500
Old Master Luo.

29:24.070 --> 29:24.920
What is it?

29:25.270 --> 29:26.160
Old Master Luo,

29:26.310 --> 29:27.830
Lord Yan has been dismissed.

29:27.830 --> 29:28.640
What?

29:28.830 --> 29:31.790
As a strategist of the Yan family,
I'm afraid you won't escape punishment.

29:31.790 --> 29:33.590
I'm afraid the entire Luo family

29:33.870 --> 29:34.950
won't be spared.

29:35.030 --> 29:36.440
An edict has been issued from the palace,

29:36.440 --> 29:38.440
and an arrest warrant will be issued soon.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.900
You should prepare early.

29:40.590 --> 29:41.440
Okay.

29:42.720 --> 29:43.960
Okay, I got it.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.170
I'll take my leave.

30:26.680 --> 30:27.400
Father,

30:27.420 --> 30:29.030
why did you call me over at this hour?

30:29.030 --> 30:30.680
I was about to go to bed.

30:39.030 --> 30:40.590
Can you perk up a little?

30:45.000 --> 30:46.030
Join the army.

30:49.790 --> 30:50.720
Do you want to go?

30:53.680 --> 30:55.510
Do you remember General Yu?

30:56.020 --> 30:56.630
Yes. Uncle Yu.

30:56.630 --> 30:57.890
I've already told him.

30:58.160 --> 30:59.310
Set off immediately

30:59.680 --> 31:01.310
and head southeast to find him.

31:01.310 --> 31:02.770
Take this letter with you.

31:04.550 --> 31:05.830
In the future,

31:08.400 --> 31:09.860
follow his arrangements.

31:10.240 --> 31:10.880
Father,

31:12.000 --> 31:14.130
has something happened to our family?

31:14.350 --> 31:15.920
What could it be?

31:17.310 --> 31:20.310
No academy in the Capital
is willing to accept you now.

31:20.750 --> 31:21.550
Really?

31:24.110 --> 31:26.400
I thought something terrible had happened.

31:26.400 --> 31:27.000
Father,

31:27.270 --> 31:27.920
you see,

31:28.200 --> 31:29.640
I told you before

31:29.640 --> 31:31.550
that I'm not cut out for studying.

31:35.270 --> 31:35.790
But...

31:35.830 --> 31:36.590
Now...

31:37.110 --> 31:38.480
Leave the city immediately?

31:38.480 --> 31:39.240
It's so late.

31:39.240 --> 31:40.750
Traveling at night isn't safe.

31:40.750 --> 31:41.920
Can I leave

31:41.920 --> 31:43.030
when I wake up tomorrow?

31:43.030 --> 31:45.070
Do you think the military camp is our home

31:45.070 --> 31:47.200
and you can go whenever you want?

31:48.720 --> 31:50.780
If you want to go, leave immediately.

31:51.200 --> 31:53.200
If you don't want to go, that's fine.

31:53.210 --> 31:54.110
Stay home and study.

31:54.110 --> 31:55.440
I'll hire a tutor for you.

31:55.440 --> 31:56.480
You choose.

31:56.720 --> 31:57.310
No, no.

31:57.310 --> 31:58.480
Spare me, Father.

31:58.480 --> 31:59.310
I'll go, okay?

31:59.310 --> 32:00.240
I'll leave right now.

32:00.240 --> 32:00.920
Alright?

32:01.880 --> 32:02.510
Master.

32:02.590 --> 32:04.030
Has everything been packed?

32:04.030 --> 32:04.830
Young Master,

32:05.030 --> 32:06.070
it's all packed.

32:07.480 --> 32:08.110
Come on, Father,

32:08.110 --> 32:10.030
you're so eager for me to leave.

32:10.030 --> 32:11.830
When did you pack all this?

32:12.550 --> 32:13.550
Remember.

32:15.000 --> 32:17.110
Work hard after you get there.

32:18.880 --> 32:20.160
If you still

32:20.310 --> 32:22.350
haven't changed your ways in 2 years,

32:22.350 --> 32:24.480
don't ever come back to the Luo family.

32:25.480 --> 32:26.480
Do you hear me?

32:26.720 --> 32:28.070
Father, rest assured.

32:29.830 --> 32:31.160
After I leave,

32:31.400 --> 32:32.960
take good care of yourself.

32:37.070 --> 32:37.830
Go now.

32:38.510 --> 32:39.440
I'm leaving then.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.030
Get out!

32:40.160 --> 32:40.950
Okay, okay.

32:44.750 --> 32:45.680
I'm leaving, Father.

32:45.680 --> 32:46.480
Let's go.

33:08.070 --> 33:09.310
Let's go have fun in Hangzhou first,

33:09.310 --> 33:10.440
then head to the military camp.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.770
We're leaving tonight.

33:13.240 --> 33:14.440
Second Young Master.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.290
Why is he in such a hurry?

33:18.860 --> 33:19.510
Master,

33:19.550 --> 33:21.830
I heard the Imperial Guards
have left the palace.

33:21.830 --> 33:23.560
What are you whispering about?

33:23.830 --> 33:24.960
Get out of here!

33:25.590 --> 33:27.510
Father,
don't be in a hurry to drive me away.

33:27.510 --> 33:28.640
Later when you miss me,

33:28.640 --> 33:30.110
you'll realize how good I am.

33:30.110 --> 33:30.750
If you don't get out of here,

33:30.750 --> 33:32.550
I... I'll change my mind!

33:32.640 --> 33:33.240
Don't!

33:33.240 --> 33:34.750
I'm leaving. Alright?

33:34.750 --> 33:35.440
Let's go.

33:36.720 --> 33:37.680
I'm leaving!

33:37.680 --> 33:39.210
Take good care of my father!

33:42.720 --> 33:43.400
Father!

33:44.070 --> 33:45.400
Don't miss me!

33:45.550 --> 33:46.440
I'm leaving!

33:48.960 --> 33:50.550
Don't miss me too much!

34:23.020 --> 34:23.630
Zhen!

34:23.710 --> 34:24.280
Zhengliang!

34:24.280 --> 34:25.030
Zhengliang, let me out!

34:25.030 --> 34:25.550
Be good!

34:25.550 --> 34:26.280
Zhengliang!

34:26.280 --> 34:26.960
Zhengliang!

34:26.960 --> 34:27.690
Zhengliang!

34:28.659 --> 34:29.510
Zhengliang!

34:30.150 --> 34:32.030
How long have you kept me locked up?

34:32.030 --> 34:33.710
Just let me out!

34:33.960 --> 34:34.800
Zhengliang!

34:47.480 --> 34:48.280
Zhengliang,

34:48.710 --> 34:49.310
aren't...

34:49.480 --> 34:50.960
Aren't you sleepy?

34:51.310 --> 34:53.510
You've been watching me day and night.

34:53.670 --> 34:55.600
You can't even get some good sleep.

34:56.190 --> 34:56.880
Besides,

34:56.880 --> 34:58.800
you haven't gone to work for days.

34:58.920 --> 34:59.760
Exactly.

35:00.230 --> 35:02.440
I've lost several days' wages.

35:03.320 --> 35:04.510
I'm keeping a record.

35:04.510 --> 35:05.480
When you have money,

35:05.480 --> 35:06.670
remember to pay me back.

35:06.670 --> 35:08.470
What does this have to do with me?

35:09.110 --> 35:11.070
We are all workers.

35:12.360 --> 35:14.220
Then you should ask Mother for it.

35:15.360 --> 35:16.110
Right.

35:16.320 --> 35:18.670
So there's one more reason
I can't let you out.

35:18.670 --> 35:20.930
Now that this has happened to Ronghua...

35:21.190 --> 35:22.670
I grew up with her.

35:22.670 --> 35:23.440
We are like sisters.

35:23.440 --> 35:25.440
She needs me the most right now.

35:25.710 --> 35:27.710
I can't just watch her family

35:27.710 --> 35:29.190
drag her into the fire!

35:29.240 --> 35:30.370
No!

35:30.400 --> 35:31.550
Mother said that

35:31.840 --> 35:33.030
as long as you still meddle in
that matter,

35:33.030 --> 35:34.550
you can't go out.

35:38.840 --> 35:40.590
If my future husband's family also wants

35:40.590 --> 35:42.710
to marry me with the rites
for taking a concubine

35:42.710 --> 35:44.570
and humiliates our whole family,

35:44.800 --> 35:47.000
would you be willing to let me marry him?

35:47.510 --> 35:48.760
Of course not.

35:48.800 --> 35:49.630
Right?

35:50.070 --> 35:50.710
Zhen!

35:50.710 --> 35:51.190
Zhengliang!

35:51.190 --> 35:51.710
How could you...

35:51.710 --> 35:52.280
No!

35:53.150 --> 35:53.920
Zhengliang!

35:59.530 --> 36:04.680
[Suburbs of Hangzhou]

36:03.360 --> 36:05.280
The scenery of Jiangnan water town

36:05.280 --> 36:07.480
is quite similar to that of our Huizhou.

36:09.110 --> 36:09.800
Sir,

36:09.840 --> 36:10.590
a pot of tea!

36:10.590 --> 36:11.520
Coming right up!

36:12.030 --> 36:12.830
Young Master,

36:12.990 --> 36:14.590
this is much happier than staying at home.

36:14.590 --> 36:15.360
Here, here.

36:15.630 --> 36:16.320
Sir.

36:16.630 --> 36:18.590
It's not far from Hangzhou, right?

36:18.710 --> 36:19.280
Yes.

36:20.630 --> 36:21.280
Hurry, hurry.

36:21.280 --> 36:22.110
Sit, sit.

36:25.440 --> 36:26.570
Here, Young Master.

36:28.960 --> 36:29.670
Did you

36:29.960 --> 36:30.800
buy a batch of

36:31.190 --> 36:32.280
Luo family's ink?

36:32.400 --> 36:33.190
Yeah, look.

36:33.190 --> 36:33.760
Right here.

36:33.760 --> 36:34.670
They're talking about our ink.

36:34.670 --> 36:35.500
This batch of ink

36:35.500 --> 36:37.620
took me a lot of effort to get.

36:37.760 --> 36:38.920
You'd better sell it quickly.

36:38.920 --> 36:40.000
I received news

36:40.000 --> 36:41.030
that the Luo family

36:41.030 --> 36:41.840
is in trouble.

36:43.030 --> 36:44.630
Old Master Luo in the Capital

36:44.710 --> 36:46.170
has been beheaded in public.

36:46.170 --> 36:46.780
What?

36:46.930 --> 36:47.280
Luo...

36:47.280 --> 36:48.420
Luo Hanzhang of Luo Ink...

36:48.420 --> 36:49.130
is dead?

36:49.960 --> 36:51.920
The government has posted the notice.

36:51.920 --> 36:53.320
Everyone in their family

36:53.360 --> 36:54.110
is awaiting trial.

36:54.110 --> 36:55.840
Then what should I do
with this batch of ink?

36:55.840 --> 36:58.070
That's why I told you to sell it quickly.

36:58.230 --> 36:59.670
Otherwise, once the news spreads,

36:59.670 --> 37:00.930
it will be hard to sell.

37:02.150 --> 37:02.960
Who are...

37:04.510 --> 37:05.710
What did you just say?

37:07.000 --> 37:07.920
Luo Hanzhang

37:08.320 --> 37:08.960
is dead.

37:11.440 --> 37:12.480
Say it again.

37:13.710 --> 37:15.360
Luo Hanzhang in the Capital

37:15.630 --> 37:16.710
is dead.

37:17.960 --> 37:19.220
Who did you say is dead?

37:19.320 --> 37:20.440
Let go of me!

37:20.440 --> 37:21.240
Young Master!

37:21.480 --> 37:23.400
Are you crazy?

37:23.510 --> 37:24.230
Listen, I'll say it again.

37:24.230 --> 37:25.280
Listen carefully.

37:25.280 --> 37:26.960
Lord Yan has fallen.

37:27.070 --> 37:29.880
As a result,
Luo Hanzhang was publicly beheaded.

37:29.920 --> 37:31.150
Everyone in the Luo family

37:31.150 --> 37:32.170
will be put on trial.

37:32.170 --> 37:33.500
Did you hear me clearly?

37:34.920 --> 37:35.920
What the hell?

37:38.190 --> 37:39.650
Take this letter with you.

37:40.070 --> 37:41.360
From now on,

37:42.230 --> 37:43.690
follow his arrangements.

37:55.030 --> 37:55.960
General Yu,

37:56.510 --> 37:58.320
the Luo family has suffered a misfortune.

37:58.320 --> 38:00.110
By the time you read this letter,

38:00.110 --> 38:02.440
I will probably no longer
be in this world.

38:02.890 --> 38:04.820
I have made many friends in my life,

38:04.840 --> 38:07.920
but you are the only one
I can trust with my children.

38:08.790 --> 38:10.170
This time, I'm taking a risk

38:10.170 --> 38:12.360
to entrust the last 2 sons
of the Luo family

38:12.360 --> 38:13.550
to you.

38:14.160 --> 38:15.290
Because I believe

38:15.320 --> 38:17.550
you are a man of honor and loyalty.

38:18.030 --> 38:19.190
I know

38:19.230 --> 38:22.840
you will take a great risk in this matter.

38:23.070 --> 38:24.190
I beg you,

38:24.190 --> 38:26.590
for the sake of our past friendship,

38:26.690 --> 38:28.510
to give my son a new name

38:28.510 --> 38:30.150
and take him under your command

38:30.150 --> 38:31.760
so that he may survive.

38:32.000 --> 38:34.030
Although my son, Wenqian, is naughty,

38:34.030 --> 38:35.590
he is pure of heart.

38:35.840 --> 38:36.760
If this time

38:36.760 --> 38:39.290
he can escape
the imperial court's bloodshed

38:39.710 --> 38:42.170
and preserve a bloodline
for the Luo family,

38:42.280 --> 38:44.400
I will be extremely grateful to you.

38:44.590 --> 38:46.360
I kowtow in deep gratitude.

38:46.710 --> 38:47.440
Jixiang!

38:47.760 --> 38:48.890
We must go to Huizhou

38:49.000 --> 38:50.400
to find Brother and Aunt.

38:59.590 --> 39:00.760
Lord Yan in the Capital

39:00.760 --> 39:01.360
made many enemies

39:01.360 --> 39:02.690
and has been impeached.

39:02.710 --> 39:04.230
The Luo family has been implicated.

39:04.230 --> 39:05.580
Knowing he cannot escape death,

39:05.580 --> 39:06.920
the Master ordered me to ride back fast

39:06.920 --> 39:08.510
to bring the news to you.

39:11.960 --> 39:12.960
Where is Wenqian?

39:13.560 --> 39:15.000
The Master has already had
the Second Young Master

39:15.000 --> 39:17.530
go find a man
named Yu Dayong in the southeast.

39:17.840 --> 39:18.710
Eldest Young Master,

39:18.710 --> 39:19.630
the arrest warrant

39:19.630 --> 39:21.230
will be sent to the city soon.

39:21.480 --> 39:22.540
The Master told you

39:22.550 --> 39:25.210
to entrust the family property
to Tian Huai'an,

39:25.320 --> 39:26.520
and then take Miss Luo

39:26.960 --> 39:27.760
to the southeast

39:27.760 --> 39:29.960
to meet up with the Second Young Master.

39:30.670 --> 39:33.590
The Master personally told us
to entrust the property to him?

39:33.590 --> 39:34.150
Yes.

39:34.150 --> 39:35.410
He said it personally.

39:35.760 --> 39:38.000
This is the recommendation letter
he prepared for you.

39:38.000 --> 39:39.000
When you reach the southeast,

39:39.000 --> 39:40.330
present it to Yu Dayong.

40:24.480 --> 40:25.550
My father told us

40:26.030 --> 40:27.760
to entrust the property to you.

40:29.110 --> 40:30.440
It's all written there.

40:30.920 --> 40:31.670
Take a look.

40:34.150 --> 40:35.950
Thank you, Eldest Young Master.

40:36.850 --> 40:38.670
The Master has shown me, Tian Huai'an,

40:38.670 --> 40:39.800
immense kindness.

40:41.000 --> 40:42.460
I will definitely not fail

40:42.800 --> 40:44.400
the trust of the Luo family.

40:45.590 --> 40:46.550
However...

40:47.480 --> 40:48.590
Speak your mind.

40:49.880 --> 40:51.190
Our Ronghua

40:51.760 --> 40:54.070
is still engaged to you.

40:54.760 --> 40:57.280
With such a major incident
happening to the Luo family,

40:57.280 --> 40:58.400
our Tian family

40:59.190 --> 41:00.800
will hardly escape unscathed.

41:00.800 --> 41:02.320
You want an annulment letter, right?

41:02.320 --> 41:03.110
Yes.

41:03.630 --> 41:04.400
It's written,

41:04.400 --> 41:05.660
and it's at the bottom.

41:22.400 --> 41:23.510
Thank you, Eldest Young Master.

41:23.510 --> 41:24.280
Go sign it.

41:40.510 --> 41:41.280
Father.

41:45.000 --> 41:45.630
Father!

41:45.880 --> 41:46.760
Tell me!

41:47.110 --> 41:49.510
Why did Luo Wensong
suddenly call you over?

41:56.110 --> 41:58.170
Lord Yan in the Capital is in trouble,

41:58.320 --> 41:59.230
and Old Master Luo

41:59.230 --> 42:00.360
is also implicated.

42:00.960 --> 42:02.360
The Luo family is doomed.

42:02.550 --> 42:03.480
So Old Master Luo

42:03.480 --> 42:04.480
left a document,

42:04.920 --> 42:06.110
asking the Eldest Young Master Luo

42:06.110 --> 42:07.370
to hand over their land

42:07.510 --> 42:08.440
and property deeds,

42:08.440 --> 42:10.070
ink workshops and stores

42:10.630 --> 42:12.030
to our Tian family

42:12.110 --> 42:13.320
for me to manage!

42:14.710 --> 42:15.360
Son!

42:15.360 --> 42:16.360
Our Tian family's

42:16.360 --> 42:17.920
time to rise has come.

42:18.230 --> 42:19.360
Let's see who dares

42:19.510 --> 42:21.240
to look down on us in the future.

42:22.360 --> 42:24.110
The Luo family has done much evil.

42:24.110 --> 42:25.910
They deserve this retribution.

42:27.710 --> 42:28.510
But Father...

42:29.000 --> 42:30.930
What about Ronghua's engagement?

42:31.630 --> 42:33.550
I've also got the annulment letter
for Ronghua.

42:33.550 --> 42:34.510
Tonight,

42:34.920 --> 42:35.670
the Eldest Young Master Luo

42:35.670 --> 42:37.130
is probably going to flee.

42:37.320 --> 42:38.150
Let him be.

42:38.360 --> 42:38.670
Let's go!

42:38.670 --> 42:39.230
Go home!

42:39.800 --> 42:40.360
Father.

42:41.550 --> 42:43.410
Luo Wensong is a wanted fugitive.

42:44.880 --> 42:47.590
Naturally, we should report this
to the county office.

42:47.590 --> 42:48.320
How could you

42:48.550 --> 42:49.710
have such a thought?

42:49.880 --> 42:52.030
The grudge over breaking the engagement
and treating us as their servants—

42:52.030 --> 42:54.360
if we don't take revenge now,
when will we?

42:54.880 --> 42:57.010
We absolutely must not let him escape.

43:00.590 --> 43:01.190
I...

43:03.150 --> 43:03.880
Chang!
